+    *   **Nodes ($N_c$)**: Represent the clusters $C_i$.
+    *   **Edges ($E_c$)**: An edge $C_{ij}$ exists between clusters $C_i$ and $C_j$ if they share at least one face through two neighbor cells in these two clusters.
